	<!-- EN: incendiary prometheum -->
	<ChargedRocketICP.label>苯基液体燃料燃烧弹</ChargedRocketICP.label>
	<!-- EN: ICP -->
	<ChargedRocketICP.labelShort>苯基燃烧弹</ChargedRocketICP.labelShort>
	<!-- EN: An incendiary payload which covers a large area in prometheum flames. The magnesium warhead explodes upon impact, launching molten slag and flaming liquid in all directions. -->
	<ChargedRocketICP.description>一种能以苯基液体燃料火焰覆盖大片区域的燃烧载荷。镁制弹头命中后爆炸，将熔融熔渣和燃烧液体溅向四周。</ChargedRocketICP.description>

